ADDITIONAL NOTES
==============================================================================

Base image: pytorch/pytorch:2.5.1-cuda12.4-cudnn9-runtime.

This image is EXPERIMENTAL and is not currently built by the Taskfiles: the
`build-experimental-runtime` task uses the directory
`runtime/experimental/{RT}/{VER}`, while this runtime lives at
`experimental/python/v3.11cuda`. The path does not match, so no image is
produced or pushed today. The Dockerfile is nevertheless part of the SOURCE
tree and therefore part of the release artifact, which is why it is
inventoried here. Confirm with the PPMC whether this runtime is intended to
be revived, moved, or deleted before the release vote.

Its requirements.txt is a plain pinned list, not a pip-compile output: unlike
runtime/python/v3.11 there is no requirements.in and no resolved transitive
closure. The real dependency set installed into the image is substantially
larger than the 21 direct requirements listed. Run inside the built image:

    pip install pip-licenses && pip-licenses --format=plain
    conda list --explicit
    dpkg-query -W -f='${Package} ${source:Package}\n'

and reconcile the output with the NOTICE and LICENSE beside this file before
a release audit.
